<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Portal Estudiantil - SisInfo</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-900 via-green-900 to-teal-900 min-h-screen p-6 relative">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl shadow-2xl p-8 border border-white/20">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
                <div class="bg-green-600 rounded-full p-3">
                    <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 14l9-5-9-5-9 5 9 5z"/>
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 14l6.16-3.422a12.083 12.083 0 01.665 6.479A11.952 11.952 0 0012 20.055a11.952 11.952 0 00-6.824-2.998 12.078 12.078 0 01.665-6.479L12 14z"/>
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 14l9-5-9-5-9 5 9 5zm0 0l6.16-3.422a12.083 12.083 0 01.665 6.479A11.952 11.952 0 0012 20.055a11.952 11.952 0 00-6.824-2.998 12.078 12.078 0 01.665-6.479L12 14zm-4 6v-7.5l4-2.222"/>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white">Portal Estudiantil</h1>
                    <p class="text-green-200">Hola, <strong>{{username}}</strong></p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <p class="text-gray-300 mb-6">Bienvenido al sistema de autogestión de alumnos.</p>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-6">
                <div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-5 text-gray-400 cursor-not-allowed">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-3 7h3m-3 4h3m-6-4h.01M9 16h.01"/>
                        </svg>
                        <span class="font-semibold">Inscribirse a materias (Próximamente)</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-5 text-gray-400 cursor-not-allowed">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 17v-2m3 2v-4m3 4v-6m2 10H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"/>
                        </svg>
                        <span class="font-semibold">Ver analítico y notas (Próximamente)</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="text-center">
                <a href="/logout" class="inline-block bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-700 text-white py-2 px-6 rounded-lg transition font-medium">
                    Cerrar Sesión
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="fixed bottom-4 right-4 opacity-70 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity">
        <img src="/images/logo_unrc.png" alt="UNRC" class="w-16 h-16 drop-shadow-lg">
    </div>
</body>
</html>